	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"&bRFTools&r 是一款全面的&6科技模组&r，旨在为玩家提供各种&a实用工具&r和&d高级机器&r。这些工具可实现高效的&3资源管理&r、&9自动化&r和&e跨维度运输&r。"
				""
				"RFTools 拥有&n&b强大的机械&r和&6自动化工具&r，可用于管理和操控能量、资源和维度。该模组包含&a建造器&r、&e存储扫描仪&r和&6维度建造器&r等设备，每种都能提供独特的能力来增强你的游戏体验。"
				""
				"&bXNet&r is an advanced &6networking mod&r that complements RFTools by providing a &9flexible&r and &cscalable&r solution for managing item, fluid, and energy transport across your base. XNet allows players to create &dcomplex networks&r using &n&bpipes&r, &n&bcables&r, and &n&bconnectors&r to efficiently route resources between machines and storage systems."
				""
				"With XNet, you can set up &n&bhighly configurable&r networks that automate &9resource distribution&r, &eenergy transfer&r, and &3machine interaction&r, all controlled through an intuitive &dcontroller interface&r. The combination of RFTools and XNet empowers players to build &dautomated systems&r that are both &6efficient&r and &bpowerful&r, making it easier to manage even the most complex setups."
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
					Icon: "kubejs:textures/gui/mark.png"
				}
			}
